{"sections":[{"slug":"可扩展性","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可扩展性"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可扩展性</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/范畴论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"可扩展性"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有有限</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">包括</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/始对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">始对象</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">可扩展</span></strong> (extensive) <span lang=\"zh\">是指如下等价条件成立</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意对象</span> $X,Y$, “<span lang=\"zh\">求和函子</span>” $\\mathcal C_{/X} \\times\\mathcal C_{/Y} \\to \\mathcal C_{/(X+Y)}$, $(Z_1\\to X, Z_2\\to Y) \\mapsto (Z_1+Z_2 \\to X+Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为等价</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意对象到</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入</span> $X \\to X+Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">沿该映射总能作</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拉回","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C_{/(X+Y)} \\to \\mathcal C_{/X}$; <span lang=\"zh\">且两个对象</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $X+Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子对象的交为</span> $0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">始对象</span>).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">假设第一个条件成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">求和函子</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的逆给出了沿</span> $X\\to X+Y$, $Y\\to X+Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拉回</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $Y\\to X+Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $0\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $Y\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的和</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">所以它拉回到</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的结果分别为</span> $0\\to X,Y\\to Y$. <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $X+Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子对象的交为</span> $0$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">假设第二个条件成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么对任意态射</span> $Z\\to X+Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">可分别将其拉回到</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这给出了函子</span>\n$\\mathcal C_{/(X+Y)} \\to \\mathcal C_{/X} \\times\\mathcal C_{/Y}$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}